      "description": "Cumulative SAS counters per device per exporter instance (grouped by device and exporter). Healthy disks show 0, not No data. There is no `smartctl_verify_*` family in smartctl-exporter 0.17.1, so verify uncorrected errors are not shown rather than faked as 0.",
